.sp
.in 8n
The main keys that work in the pager are as follows (the same while viewing a file in the file manager). When started as a pager, only the keys on the lines of this \fBHELP\fR that start with a tab (these, plus those in the \fBFGREP\fR, \fBEGREP\fR, \fBEPUB\fR and other chapters) and ^M can be used.
.in 0
